COMMENT     The assembly wsMarCava1.1 is based on 32x PacBio data and Arima2
            Hi-C data generated as part of the European Reference Genome Atlas
            (ERGA, https://www.erga-biodiversity.eu/) via the Biodiversity
            Genomics Europe project (BGE, https://biodiversitygenomics.eu/).
            The assembly process included the following sequence of steps:
            initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based
            scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using
            MitoHiFi. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually
            improved using rapid curation. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed
            by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size.
